<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus Airways announces new schedules.</title>
<headline>Cyprus Airways announces new schedules.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus Airways said on Friday it would add four new destinations in Europe to its summer flight schedule.</p>
<p>It said it would start flights to Strasbourg and Lyon in France, to Dresden in Germany and Stanstead in Britain.</p>
<p>The Strasbourg and Lyon flights will be carried out every Tuesday from April 15. The Dresden flights start on March 30 every Sunday and Friday and the Stanstead flight every Tuesday from May 6.</p>
<p>Cyprus Airways currently flies to 19 European destinations and 9 in the Middle East.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
